{"r0": "gid://shopify/Product/16104470348158", "t0": [{"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "meta_description", "value": "Caixa com três azeites virgem extra da Andaluzia para comparar: Hojiblanca, Arbosana e Picual. Uma ideia de presente. Enviada a partir de Paris.", "translatableContentDigest": "b06f2e984166fe5267954fb1d3055223e1c2d61e2dc3461186411c9ce1a5a854"}], "r1": "gid://shopify/Product/16104474182014", "t1": [{"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "title", "value": "Azeite virgem extra Arbequina ecológico, 1 L", "translatableContentDigest": "7365d88fda1b1c676a54c0408bec6fe09b86b4ced48c25e6015a1095c3bd31be"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "body_html", "value": "<p>Uma Arbequina ecológica (certificado ecológico), em grande formato para a cozinha de todos os dias.</p><h4>O sabor</h4><p>Suave e frutada, com notas de amêndoa fresca e um toque de erva acabada de cortar.</p><h4>Como utilizar</h4><p>Um fio sobre os legumes, nas saladas ou em cozedura a baixa temperatura.</p><h4>Em resumo</h4><ul>\n<li>Variedade: Arbequina</li>\n<li>Ecológico (certificado ecológico)</li>\n<li>Origem: Andaluzia, Espanha</li>\n<li>Colheita precoce, prensagem a frio</li>\n<li>Garrafa de 1 L</li>\n</ul>", "translatableContentDigest": "bb6c49e880fed77dc32bf42dc01859c9305c14114a94d013b4370b9c52d34f1e"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "meta_description", "value": "Azeite virgem extra Arbequina ecológico, suave e frutado, em garrafa de 1 L. Prensado a frio na Andaluzia. Enviado a partir de Paris.", "translatableContentDigest": "b1dd57b3bda405101f5c7732e95850cf13f67e055f9aed7031adec474c4dbf44"}], "r2": "gid://shopify/Collection/747176821118", "t2": [{"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "title", "value": "Página inicial", "translatableContentDigest": "9b87f4b2595358107b068c38c1d573df79daa3bcc33e69c195d05c165aa071b5"}], "r3": "gid://shopify/Collection/750857027966", "t3": [{"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "title", "value": "Azeites", "translatableContentDigest": "6dd52773a526fa626da9bfd427b9db458fe6be7f16300b226267f7582c6f6598"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "body_html", "value": "<p>Os nossos azeites virgem extra vêm da Andaluzia. Colhidos cedo, prensados a frio, importados diretamente de Espanha. Arbequina, lote ou caixa de três variedades: para provar em cru, no pão, em legumes ou num peixe.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "9aad5f8405552b38ff36d28020a57236092a8adc6e5c00ddbdac4aa8ebe26b2b"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "meta_description", "value": "Azeites virgem extra da Andaluzia, colhidos cedo e prensados a frio. Arbequina, Coupage e caixa de prova. Enviados a partir de Paris.", "translatableContentDigest": "830daaf1214f1119eac0f10e5b0254572516955a01112740c3b2df1218d761b1"}], "r4": "gid://shopify/Collection/753182933374", "t4": [{"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "title", "value": "Presuntos ibéricos", "translatableContentDigest": "b6f2cbe8f02f8fa39172136b5831084a6133cc9120398d781213f1c96b4e78bd"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "body_html", "value": "<p>Presuntos ibéricos. Preços indicados ao kg para as peças inteiras e desossadas. Os formatos fatiados são vendidos por 100 g, segundo o método de corte indicado.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "2eec7a07906b74fa93fe6246eef238348fcd99540ae0b452c94f4188c96dcc46"}], "r5": "gid://shopify/Collection/753182966142", "t5": [{"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "title", "value": "Paletas ibéricas", "translatableContentDigest": "8f2b186a50ab9155425064b9c08bf2b46d133eb1b7ce0d5bd820431b2a632f28"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "body_html", "value": "<p>Paletas ibéricas. Preços indicados ao kg para as peças inteiras e desossadas. Os formatos fatiados são vendidos por 100 g quando o preço está disponível.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "30dedd1022a151a15446e29d16c0b59aa6c39c1b5f8b084f2a25038949f865c6"}], "r6": "gid://shopify/Collection/753182998910", "t6": [{"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "title", "value": "Charcutaria ibérica", "translatableContentDigest": "5868ba6599344b4a2e493a91f26a4f1cb37d1f47acab790136aa9e97ae18e108"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "body_html", "value": "<p>Enchidos ibéricos em peça.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "9b11f36b5e0d94324dc04fa8acabada8624aa8f8ab9dd2092fc2e939c6422847"}], "r7": "gid://shopify/Collection/753408344446", "t7": [{"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "title", "value": "Azeites", "translatableContentDigest": "88f6fce9dced24c202bd716498bd7c77d94a8f3b3492c8ba42c3ea6ee5853f40"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "body_html", "value": "<p>Azeites virgem extra andaluzes e caixas de prova, escolhidos diretamente junto dos produtores.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "2403035fa1dab587c62e9c856aa302d7d6c103531ecbec630774f658a04ffb7f"}], "r8": "gid://shopify/Link/1448309719422", "t8": [{"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "title", "value": "Início", "translatableContentDigest": "533161735639c51adb4623f3780b497601d7b82108e6f03f5b65b5dd4c89f616"}], "r9": "gid://shopify/Link/1448309784958", "t9": [{"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "title", "value": "Contacto", "translatableContentDigest": "2b5c3d26721ae9c350cf3009318b626f0fc8a90b4a2ac0ca8099c05aa849282e"}], "r10": "gid://shopify/Link/1448309817726", "t10": [{"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "title", "value": "Pesquisar", "translatableContentDigest": "733d1c742675f53792b10c780b3584b2197101e56f892ca382c35133ca6dce55"}], "r11": "gid://shopify/Link/1448309850494", "t11": [{"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "title", "value": "Encomendas", "translatableContentDigest": "0e3118a24b9ff7bdffb66c7342f1ad65016394b6cc2db7abc9a93b184560b82c"}], "r12": "gid://shopify/Link/1448309883262", "t12": [{"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "title", "value": "Perfil", "translatableContentDigest": "e267d343821f264e61be7d66ef27acd640e0cdb4ef2df9b54ad6ebff0f3ab35f"}], "r13": "gid://shopify/Link/1464601018750", "t13": [{"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "title", "value": "Contacto", "translatableContentDigest": "2b5c3d26721ae9c350cf3009318b626f0fc8a90b4a2ac0ca8099c05aa849282e"}], "r14": "gid://shopify/Link/1464601051518", "t14": [{"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "title", "value": "Quem somos", "translatableContentDigest": "307ef284ba576615fa72dc9a25e2102cd12